<title>USA: Omaha hogs, no sales - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs, no sales - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>No sales reported on barrows and gilts. - USDA.</p>
<p>Sows: Steady to $2 higher. Top $55.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>US 1-3    350-450 lbs    44.50</p>
<p>	    450-500 lbs    49.00-51.00</p>
<p>US 2-3    500-650 lbs    53.00-55.00</p>
</text>
